# dismiss-logbox

# section open-debugger-notice
# React Native development builds can place this migration notice directly over
# pinned controls on iPad. Open its debugger explicitly, preserve the
# warning output there, and prove the notice left before the next app action.
press "label=\"!, Open debugger to view warnings.\""
wait absent "label=\"!, Open debugger to view warnings.\"" 10000

